<title>UK: BUPA buys 11.45 million Goldsborough shares.</title>
<headline>BUPA buys 11.45 million Goldsborough shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British private health provider BUPA bought 11.45 million shares in bid target Goldsborough Healthcare Plc at 173 pence a share.</p>
<p>BUPA now holds 12.88 million shares or 29.39 percent of Goldsborough. BUPA earlier announced it is offering 175 pence per share in a total 76.6 million stg cash offer.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
